<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.6;">
  <h2 style="color: #111827;">Account update</h2>
  <p>Hi <strong><%= name %></strong>,</p>
  <p>We reviewed your recent shift performance and noticed your latest rating was <strong><%= rating %> stars</strong>.</p>
  <p>As a result, your ability to apply for new shifts has been temporarily disabled while we review your account.</p>
  <p>If you believe this is a mistake, please contact support or log in to your account to view any updates.</p>
  <p style="margin-top: 24px;">Thank you,<br/><strong><%= appName %> Team</strong></p>
  <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #6b7280;">You can sign in at <a href="<%= loginUrl %>"><%= loginUrl %></a></p>
</div>
